---
// Wraps rendered guide markdown. The outline files keep one logical line per row without blank
// lines between them, so soft line breaks are preserved (pre-line) instead of merged.
---

<div class="prose guide-prose"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .guide-prose :global(p) { white-space: pre-line; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .guide-prose :global(li) { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .guide-prose :global(strong) { color: var(--text); }
</style>
